# tools/local.env — per-machine settings for tools/run_tests.sh,
# tools/offline_selftest.sh and tools/lan_selftest.sh.
#
# Copy this file to tools/local.env and uncomment/edit what you need.
# tools/local.env is gitignored, so it stays machine specific.
#
# Precedence: an exported G47/OUT in the environment wins over this file,
# which wins over the script's built-in default.
#
# On Windows, run the scripts from Git Bash with `sh`, e.g.
#   sh tools/run_tests.sh
# (plain `bash` may be WSL's bash, and direct execution fails).

# Godot 4.7 binary.
# Windows (Git Bash) — forward slashes, no quotes:
# G47=D:/Godot_v4.6-stable_win64.exe/Godot_v4.7.2-stable_win64_console.exe
# Linux:
# G47=/home/dev/Project/self/Godot_v4.7.2-stable_linux.x86_64

# Log directory. Defaults: run_tests /tmp, offline_selftest
# /tmp/offline_selftest, lan_selftest /tmp/lan_selftest.
# OUT=/tmp/rf_logs
